WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:18.863
Rosa counted dimes and quarters.

2
00:00:18.864 --> 00:00:22.456
"We have five dollars," she said.

3
00:00:22.457 --> 00:00:24.040
Jo grinned.

4
00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:28.235
"Now can we buy that magic kit?"

5
00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.200
"Not yet," said Rosa.

6
00:00:31.201 --> 00:00:35.447
"But we can do a magic trick."

7
00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:38.627
"How?" asked Jo.

8
00:00:38.628 --> 00:00:42.680
"First, we need some lemons," said Rosa.

9
00:00:42.681 --> 00:00:54.434
"Then, we'll turn the lemons into money!"

10
00:00:54.435 --> 00:01:01.927
Later the twins set up a table and a sign.

11
00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:17.663
They had pitchers of lemonade and cups.

12
00:01:17.664 --> 00:01:21.392
A boy rode by on a bike.

13
00:01:21.393 --> 00:01:26.377
"Hey!" Rosa shouted. "Want some lemonade?

14
00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:32.993
It only costs two dollars!"

15
00:01:32.994 --> 00:01:36.904
"Two dollars for lemonade?" said the boy.

16
00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:43.495
"Are you crazy?"

17
00:01:43.496 --> 00:01:48.236
"Ice-cold lemonade!" Rosa shouted to a woman.

18
00:01:48.237 --> 00:01:52.198
The woman looked at the price.

19
00:01:52.199 --> 00:01:59.152
"No, thanks," she said.

20
00:01:59.153 --> 00:02:06.575
"Hmm...," thought Jo. "I have an idea!"

21
00:02:06.576 --> 00:02:10.534
Soon lots of people were buying lemonade.

22
00:02:10.535 --> 00:02:15.151
"Good idea, Jo," said Rosa.

23
00:02:15.152 --> 00:02:18.396
"Two dollars was too expensive.

24
00:02:18.397 --> 00:02:28.085
Fifty cents is a better price."

25
00:02:28.086 --> 00:02:30.606
"Look!" said Jo.

26
00:02:30.607 --> 00:02:33.396
"We made twenty dollars!

27
00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:36.209
I know what to buy now."

28
00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:39.078
"The magic kit?" asked Rosa.

29
00:02:39.079 --> 00:02:51.790
"Nope," said Jo. "More lemons!"
